From 1f1aa2723d97a3234bbe773d87d2cfb5ec09a126 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:35:37 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] 0300: glm_moe_dsa's shape (config) + CUDA dispatch for
 full GLM-5.3

config.zig: max_layers 96; dsa/rope fields; the ifull bitset (indexer_types);
the dsa parse branch (no text_config, no index_kpool/hc_mult/linear_attn_config),
dsaWant() template, dsa early widths check (error.NotGlm53Dsa), whole() dsa counts.
cuda.zig: glm_moe_dsa routes into glm.native before the registry; pull metadata
gains the family entry (formats exl3). cuda_refusal.zig: the mtp flag refusals
cover glm_moe_dsa with GLM-5.3's own wording. Tests: dsa parse + TP4 split.
---
 zig/src/families/glm/config.zig | 187 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 zig/src/native/cuda.zig         |   4 +-
 zig/src/native/cuda_refusal.zig |   8 +-
 3 files changed, 179 insertions(+), 20 deletions(-)

